/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>院系介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/UAsSwQpzASedbAwVDDwZU5OM4xyDFgRDvkPx41Nzmjqns1WUUicTfMuvWjqeEQpF1HtszpibJ7NiaovDgvEWK9nQjCn0xicWfSulFW2XibdOpkAw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/UAsSwQpzASeicJkibaPtpjhv6A4qz8gicRajv9jtoEvR14Cfksl1qAVMaCwbpVj4icWqsI7An2tKHNc6k1yma5pOr6sEuR6wTcRRVtmKoiao66Fk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>华东师范大学上海智能教育研究院（智能教育实验室）系</span><strong><span>华东师大与上海市教委共建研究机构</span></strong><span>，<span>教育部与上海市教育综合改革共建重点项目</span>，</span><strong><span>首创智能教育跨学科博士生培养</span></strong><span>，突出人工智能解决教育问题的不可代替性，发挥教育学、心理学、脑科学、计算机科学、软件工程以及数学、设计等文理学科综合优势，与欧美、一带一路国家保持经常性交流，吸收前沿技术，带动区域教育水平提高，探索把研发作为产业来做、把技术作为商品来做的有效路径，推进研究和产品不断更新迭代，把人才培养和科学研究结合作为特色，把产教融合作为抓手，把学校联盟协同创新作为有效路径。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>2020年9月，华东师范大学开设</span><strong><span>全国首个智能教育博士班</span></strong><span>，也是全国范围内较早开始交叉学科人才培养探索的高校；2021年，结合华师大特色学科教育学科和信息学科，上海智能教育研究院在计算机科学与技术一级学科下新设</span><strong><span>智能教育二级学科</span></strong><span>，针对教育领域的新问题与新挑战，开展人工智能与教育的交叉融合研究，旨在培养“智能+教育”的综合性人才并进行相关的科学研究，用人工智能技术推动教育现代化。围绕计算机科学与技术的理论与方法，结合教育学、心理学、数学、软件工程等学科，遵循基础学科的发展规律，进行相应的研究，将多学科交叉融合，在人工智能+教育领域进行研究，培养人工智能+教育的复合型人才。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>上海智能教育研究院招生学科</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>硕士（专业学位）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>电子信息（人工智能）085410</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>博士（学术学位）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>计算机科学与技术081200</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/UAsSwQpzAScwibUnhusqWMLZogSYYUyEMFXmzoM4ribWAKC5o5LfXv4yOshDiaYdlq0sibNOd726SapFVicxtIWsT26WlBunlcv4qdC9K0TRGMac/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/UAsSwQpzAScwibUnhusqWMLZogSYYUyEMFXmzoM4ribWAKC5o5LfXv4yOshDiaYdlq0sibNOd726SapFVicxtIWsT26WlBunlcv4qdC9K0TRGMac/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>报名条件</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/UAsSwQpzA