<section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/UAsSwQpzASedbAwVDDwZU5OM4xyDFgRDvkPx41Nzmjqns1WUUicTfMuvWjqeEQpF1HtszpibJ7NiaovDgvEWK9nQjCn0xicWfSulFW2XibdOpkAw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/UAsSwQpzASeicJkibaPtpjhv6A4qz8gicRajv9jtoEvR14Cfksl1qAVMaCwbpVj4icWqsI7An2tKHNc6k1yma5pOr6sEuR6wTcRRVtmKoiao66Fk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>申请人登录我校研招系统夏令营模块（</span><strong><span>https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=4</span></strong><span>），进行填报。</span></p><p><span>报名时间：</span><strong><span>7月1日9:00--7月10日17:00</span></strong><span>。</span></p></li></ol><p><strong><span>提交材料包括：</span></strong></p><p><span>①申请人有效期内身份证正反面扫描件；</span></p><p><span>②夏令营诚信承诺书；（按照系统提示，下载—打印—签名后上传）</span></p><p><span>③华东师范大学优秀大学生夏令营申请表；</span></p><p><span>④申请人个人简历；</span></p><p><span>⑤其他佐证材料，包括但不限于：申请人成绩单；英语能力证明；毕业证书、学位证书（申请博士人员提交）；科研能力证明材料等。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>2.学员遴选与确认：</span></strong></p><p><span>①主办方将根据申请者提交的学业成绩、论文等材料综合进行评价，对申请者进行入围资格评审，择优录取。</span></p><p><span>②入围通知预计于7月15日左右发送。如未收到通知，即为未获得入围资格。</span></p><p><span>③如发现申请人提交虚假材料，将取消资格并告知申请人所在学校相关部门。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/UAsSwQpzAScwibUnhusqWMLZogSYYUyEMFXmzoM4ribWAKC5o5LfXv4yOshDiaYdlq0sibNOd726SapFVicxtIWsT26WlBunlcv4qdC9K0TRGMac/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/UAsSwQpzAScwibUnhusqWMLZo